  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Scottus de Scottis, sanus mente et corpore, relinquo monasterio Sancti Salvatoris de Monte Amiata triginta libras denariorum senensium ut monachi ibidem degentes pro anima mea missas celebrent singulis mensibus, et filio meo Iacobo castellum meum in Val d'Arbia cum omnibus pertinentiis suis.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam ultimam voluntatem venire temptaverit, anathema sit et insuper componat libras ducentas denariorum senensium, quarum dimidia pars sit ecclesiae et alia heredibus meis.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Petrus de Vecchiettis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Angelus de Buonfiglis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Fortis de Bandinellis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Gratianus de Squarcialupis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
